<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">Welcome back, {{firstName}}! 💚</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">It is wonderful to have you volunteering with Parinaam again. Your account is active and you can enroll in sessions right away.</p>
{{#if communityName}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Last time you served <strong>{{communityName}}</strong>{{#if upcomingCount}} — and there {{#if upcomingPlural}}are <strong>{{upcomingCount}} upcoming sessions</strong>{{else}}is <strong>1 upcoming session</strong>{{/if}} for that community{{/if}}:</p>
{{#if sessions.length}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
{{#each sessions}}
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5e6a62;">{{this.date}}</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{this.name}}</td></tr>
{{/each}}
</table>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;"><a href="{{webUrl}}/app/events" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d96c3f,#bc5328);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;">Browse sessions</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5e6a62;font-size:13px;">Your trainings and certificates are exactly where you left them.</p>
